\f0\b Phase2 Calculators (implemented)
\f1\b0 \
qSOFA, MEWS, HEART, GRACE (coarse), SOFA (minimal), D-dimer (age-adjusted; pregnancy aware), Troponin \uc0\u916 \u327  (delta, absolute and percent), Wells PE/DVT, PERC, PESI + sPESI, SIRS, Sepsis-3 (with shock flag), Marburg, Glasgow-Blatchford (GI bleed), Child-Pugh, corrected calcium (albumin), anion gap (albumin-corrected).\
